    "The outline of the strike plate is marked and recessed with a marking knife and chisel.",
    "The strike plate is then fitted and secured into the recess.",
    "The lip of the strike plate can be bent slightly around the frame edge to help the door close smoothly.",
    "The lip is meant to project past the frame face to protect the frame from latch impact.",
